{"content": "The release codename mentioned in the comment is **AZURE-LANTERN-8090**.\n\nThe first class defined in the excerpt, `Message`, serves as the basic object for the email package's object model, representing an email message with RFC 2822 headers and a payload. It provides methods to manipulate headers, access or modify the payload (which can be a string or a list of sub-messages), and serialize the message into string or bytes formats.", "reasoning": null, "logprobs": [{"token": "The", "logprob": -0.3769645871784739, "top_logprobs": [{"token": "The", "logprob": -0.3769645871784739}, {"token": "Based", "logprob": -1.4374466123249583}, {"token": "1", "logprob": -2.838684100117927}, {"token": "First", "logprob": -5.022651690449958}, {"token": "**", "logprob": -5.08716012856031}, {"token": "###", "logprob": -5.832963961568122}, {"token": "Here", "logprob": -6.354700106587654}, {"token": "-", "logprob": -8.96516420265699}, {"token": "Release", "logprob": -9.225469607320075}, {"token": "#", "logprob": -9.756427782979255}, {"token": "No", "logprob": -10.523016947713142}, {"token": "What", "logprob": -10.840553301778083}, {"token": "2", "logprob": -10.868665713277107}, {"token": "based", "logprob": -11.087755221333747}, {"token": "Answer", "logprob": -11.238872546162849}, {"token": "*", "logprob": -11.372928637471443}, {"token": "3", "logprob": -11.457305926289802}, {"token": "<think>", "logprob": -11.54883005043531}, {"token": "```", "logprob": -11.550381678548103}, {"token": "To", "logprob": -11.659487742390876}]}, {"token": " release", "logprob": -0.00024814506167203376, "top_logprobs": [{"token": " release", "logprob": -0.00024814506167203376}, {"token": " first", "logprob": -8.438530158001125}, {"token": " specific", "logprob": -13.068319510418117}, {"token": " second", "logprob": -13.120863150554836}, {"token": " mention", "logprob": -13.19659633536929}, {"token": " code", "logprob": -13.217519949871242}, {"token": " ", "logprob": -13.290142249065578}, {"to