{"content": "The release codename mentioned in the comment is **AZURE-TUNDRA-1150**.\n\nThe first class defined in the excerpt, `_HAS_DEFAULT_FACTORY_CLASS`, serves as a sentinel object to signal that a field's default value should be initialized using a factory function rather than a static value. It provides a custom `__repr__` method that returns the string `'<factory>'` to make debugging and function signatures more readable.", "reasoning": null, "logprobs": [{"token": "The", "logprob": -0.3329623911885058, "top_logprobs": [{"token": "The", "logprob": -0.3329623911885058}, {"token": "Based", "logprob": -1.6221107218769824}, {"token": "1", "logprob": -2.8566154215840136}, {"token": "**", "logprob": -4.391058323195342}, {"token": "First", "logprob": -4.888721821120146}, {"token": "###", "logprob": -5.196123478224639}, {"token": "Here", "logprob": -6.3930743907002245}, {"token": "Release", "logprob": -8.37141072492874}, {"token": "-", "logprob": -8.73122632246292}, {"token": "No", "logprob": -9.312988636305693}, {"token": "#", "logprob": -9.348490116408232}, {"token": "What", "logprob": -9.910986301710967}, {"token": "based", "logprob": -10.323101398756865}, {"token": "2", "logprob": -10.403681156447295}, {"token": "```", "logprob": -10.550698635390166}, {"token": "release", "logprob": -10.710809109022978}, {"token": "Answer", "logprob": -10.8847430918721}, {"token": "Yes", "logprob": -10.898304340651396}, {"token": "3", "logprob": -11.11366212110794}, {"token": "*", "logprob": -11.121391651442412}]}, {"token": " release", "logprob": -0.00025417662829596566, "top_logprobs": [{"token": " release", "logprob": -0.00025417662829596566}, {"token": " first", "logprob": -8.440866969597046}, {"token": " code", "logprob": -12.061502955925171}, {"token": " mention", "logprob": -12.373417399894898}, {"token": " second", "logprob": -12.777414821159546}, {"token": " comment", "logprob": -12.967154048454468}, {"token": " ", "logprob": -13.136148952018921}, {"token": " two", "log